{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/472745-have-you-eaten-your-agg-flakes","id":472745,"title":"Have you eaten your Agg-flakes?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Werewolf: The Forsaken"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-04-08T08:01:08-07:00","id":472745,"title":"Have you eaten your Agg-flakes?","content":"Being as 2E has been out for a while now, I'm guessing a fair number of players have had opportunities to eat people for essence and aggrivated damage.<br /> <br /> How did that go for you? Tell us about your experience.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4563-terraben","name":"TerraBen","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"278"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-08T08:13:02-07:00","id":472781,"title":"","content":"I posted about it when mentioning my first hunt. It went surprisingly fast, and at Strength 2 and Brawl 1 my character isn't exactly optimized for combat. It took two hits from two characters to really bring them down, and they weren't exactly going anywhere after the first. We ruled that 4 boxes of aggravated damage inflicted by an urshul going for leg wrack equals no leg.<br /> <br /> If I were to go urshul it would bring my Strength up to 4, and with the Brawl and the +2 damage from their teeth, theoretically that's a big enough dicepool to kill your average 7 Health human in one chomp of the teeth. I think the game really gets across a sense of power to the werewolf form with that, but it's balanced out by the hosts being a numerous opponent, other opponents being able to heal very fast, some things simply lowering the damage type, and the 'Do what the story needs,' 